&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3781 - Associate Director, Media Planning, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Media Planning Account Director works within a team of media planners with 1-3 direct reports, inspiring&amp;nbsp;innovation&amp;nbsp;and great thinking. Role will&amp;nbsp;include:&amp;nbsp;Strategic thinking, forecasting, weekly reporting&amp;nbsp;reviews&amp;nbsp;and campaign PCAs or QBRs. They will work with the team to ensure communication to the client is clear, compelling and of a high standard. The candidate will hold close client relationships and work alongside Client Services as the primary face of Essence’s acquisition media planning product for those clients. They will be&amp;nbsp;ultimately responsible&amp;nbsp;for campaign performance and the delivery of business-enhancing innovation. They will foster strong external relationships and keep a close eye on the market to ensure new opportunities and research are reviewed and implemented for the benefit of their clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will be a key player in the planning team for Google Ads, defining contextual layers and precision of budgets across channels, and to help evolve best practice, including pushing the adoption of&amp;nbsp;emerging&amp;nbsp;technologies, leading the development and deployment of planning frameworks and the main POC for clients from planning. Managing the team to deliver planning and buying of activity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Some of the things&amp;nbsp;we’d&amp;nbsp;like you to do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be the point of contact for Planning across junior and&amp;nbsp;mid level&amp;nbsp;clients, lead weekly meetings with clients and presentations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Oversee and quality assure all deliverables produced by junior team members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ensure the delivery of&amp;nbsp;high quality&amp;nbsp;strategic presentations, actionable weekly reporting, insightful post campaign&amp;nbsp;analysis&amp;nbsp;and clear briefs to Activation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deliver clear and compelling rationale to support media investment recommendations and to evidence campaign performance versus expected outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work with Activation and Analytics to design the test and learn framework for assigned campaigns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Take responsibility for the performance of assigned media budgets against intended outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be a point of escalation for team issues (within and outside the team).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Contribute to internal thought leadership and team process/workflow enhancement, increasing work quality, making us more efficient, and increasing Essential satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Set the quality standard for one or more planning deliverables per year, improving them over time via team/client feedback and incorporation of evolving external context.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Management Responsibility:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Motivate a team, leading by example while coaching juniors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide&amp;nbsp;timely&amp;nbsp;and actionable feedback to aid in team development and improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong spreadsheet capability is&amp;nbsp;a must, with a strong handle on using formulas and ideally able to use AI to build scripts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Monitor and support Essential satisfaction across client teams,&amp;nbsp;identifying&amp;nbsp;and implementing ways to&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;or increase satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Foster strong working relationships across the client team to&amp;nbsp;facilitate&amp;nbsp;flawless execution of plans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Communicate effectively across all levels of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Understand when to escalate issues to managers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Calculate the workload implication of new campaigns and feed into resource management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide awareness and recognition for jobs well done.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp;WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people.&amp;nbsp;It’s&amp;nbsp;what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace&amp;nbsp;WPP &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;WPP Media’s&amp;nbsp;shared&amp;nbsp;core&amp;nbsp;values:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Create an&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Open&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;environment by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Optimistically&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience in a digital media agency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ability to work in a team environment that promotes collaboration; but also capable of working independently when needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Exceptional verbal &amp;amp; written communication skills - ability to think on your feet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills - ability to analyze raw data,&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;true insight and develop actionable recommendations. A natural affinity with numbers is&amp;nbsp;a must.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong interpersonal skills – able to forge strong relationships and influence clients,&amp;nbsp;partners&amp;nbsp;and colleagues alike.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Life at&amp;nbsp;WPP Media&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment.&amp;nbsp;WPP Media&amp;nbsp;employees can tap into the global&amp;nbsp;WPP Media&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media&amp;nbsp;is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to&amp;nbsp;particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3133 - Associate Director, Commerce, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an eCommerce Associate Director, you will be responsible for the coordination and delivery of your client accounts across platforms whilst operating as the main campaign activation point of contact for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Utilising platform expertise and account management practices, you’ll ensure effective management of projects to brief, schedule and budget. Ultimately, you’ll work to deliver industry-leading eCommerce campaigns which exceed our clients’ expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will involve line management of more junior members of the team, overseeing their work and development to successfully deliver to client expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work across well-known brands with a desire for innovation and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working within a truly collaborative agency model with great opportunities for continued cross-media and performance marketing learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A talented team supporting each other in implementing best-in-class, award winning campaigns, and has fun along the way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measures of success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;In three months, you would have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven to be the day-to-day lead for client contacts as well as internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseen the team’s workflow management, from brief to post-campaign analysis, striving for operational effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensured that client objectives and KPI targets are understood and optimised towards every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proposed short and long-term optimisations to develop the accounts and deliver improved performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenged inherited ways of working with your own ideas for improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 12 months, you would have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gained a complete understanding of the clients’ business and their needs, and shaped the eCommerce strategy in line with it, whilst incorporating industry developments and market changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an extension of the clients’ teams, providing added value for eCommerce and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shown to be proactive, and a real driver who inspires direct reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities of the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specialist Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsibility for the output of your team, both client facing and operational, and accountability for adherence to controls and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic understanding of the clients’ business and KPIs, keeping up to date with latest industry news and proactively spotting trends, product releases, and other opportunities which could enhance our activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a forward thinking and innovative approach in the development of all activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong relationships with your client and key suppliers, leading team communications with these stakeholders. Be able to communicate with clients on subject matters (even outside of your remit) and provide them with useful insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take responsibility for your team’s development and career progression within the agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play an active role in recruitment and interviewing processes to build strong teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;External and Internal Communication &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication lead with the client contacts, media partners and internal stakeholders with the support of the Senior Associate Director when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong relationships with your client, and key suppliers. Foster a good working relationship across client team stakeholders to facilitate flawless execution of plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process and Systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping to drive process automation through adoption of technology and efficient ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead on application and adherence to all areas of activation related finance process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributes to the development of strategic revenue and services opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;In-depth understanding of eCommerce campaign set-up, management, optimisation and reporting across media owner and technology vendor platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of the strategic and tactical application of eCommerce and digital marketing in general&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven project management, leadership and people management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nscale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nscale is the GPU cloud engineered for AI. We provide cost-effective, high-performance infrastructure for AI start-ups and large enterprise customers. &amp;nbsp;Nscale enables AI-focused companies to achieve superior results by reducing the complexity of AI development. Our GPU cloud bolsters technical capabilities and directly supports strategic business outcomes, including cost management, rapid innovation, and environmental responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Nscale, our Legal &amp;amp; Compliance team plays a critical role in driving business success by partnering with stakeholders to anticipate regulatory change, operationalize compliance requirements, and deliver solutions that protect the company while enabling commercial opportunities, to scale confidently, sustainably, and with integrity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thrive on a culture of relentless innovation, ownership, and accountability, where every team member takes pride in their work and drives it with excellence and urgency. As an Nscaler, you’ll build trust through openness and transparency, where everyone is inspired to do their best work. If you join our team, you’ll be contributing to building the technology that powers the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Indirect Procurement&lt;/strong&gt; will support strategic sourcing and procurement activities across Nscale’s indirect spend categories, helping the business scale efficiently while maintaining strong commercial discipline, supplier governance and cost control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will partner closely with Finance and functional leaders across the organisation to develop category strategies, support or lead supplier negotiations, improve procurement processes and ensure Nscale receives strong commercial value from its third-party spend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The remit will focus primarily on &lt;strong&gt;indirect categories outside of core AI Infrastructure and Data Center equipment procurement&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing &amp;amp; Procurement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support procurement across &lt;strong&gt;IT &amp;amp; software, professional services, marketing, HR/recruitment, travel, facilities and other corporate services&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-create and execute category strategies aligned with business requirements and growth plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead competitive &lt;strong&gt;RFP/RFQ processes&lt;/strong&gt;, supplier selection and commercial negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate pricing, commercial terms, service levels and contract renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for &lt;strong&gt;cost savings, supplier consolidation and demand optimisation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Partnering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with functional leaders to understand requirements, planned expenditure and upcoming procurement needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide commercial challenge to ensure purchasing decisions deliver appropriate value for money.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Finance to improve visibility of &lt;strong&gt;committed and forecast spend&lt;/strong&gt; and support budget management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support stakeholders in evaluating suppliers and commercial proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier &amp;amp; Contract Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage supplier relationships and establish appropriate performance governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor supplier performance, pricing, contractual commitments and service levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Legal and business owners on contract negotiations, renewals and commercial risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain visibility of key contract dates and proactively manage renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Procurement Governance &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of appropriate &lt;strong&gt;purchase requisition, PO and approval processes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support procurement policies, controls and delegated authority requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve spend visibility, procurement reporting and supplier data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development and optimisation of procurement systems and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain appropriate procurement audit trails and support the wider financial control environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Categories&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology:&lt;/strong&gt; SaaS, software licensing, corporate IT and telecoms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Services:&lt;/strong&gt; Consulting, legal, accounting and advisory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People:&lt;/strong&gt; Recruitment agencies, contractors, training and benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing:&lt;/strong&gt; Agencies, events, sponsorship and communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; TMC, airlines, hotels and related services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Corporate Services:&lt;/strong&gt; Facilities, workplace, insurance and other indirect spend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Core &lt;strong&gt;GPU/AI infrastructure and Data Center construction/equipment procurement would sit outside the role’s primary remit&lt;/strong&gt;, with collaboration across those procurement teams as required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant procurement experience, ideally within a &lt;strong&gt;technology, cloud, infrastructure or high-growth international business&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience across multiple indirect procurement categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in strategic sourcing, competitive tenders and complex commercial negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of supplier economics, contracts and total cost of ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially minded with strong analytical and financial skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to challenge senior stakeholders while maintaining strong relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with procurement/P2P platforms such as &lt;strong&gt;SAP Ariba&lt;/strong&gt; or equivalent advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a rapidly scaling international organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measures of Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustainable procurement savings and cost avoidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increased spend under Procurement management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved contract and supplier visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Greater use of competitive sourcing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduced supplier fragmentation and unnecessary spend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved PO and procurement-policy compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial support to business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overall focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a commercially focused indirect procurement capability that enables Nscale to scale efficiently, strengthens control over third-party spend and delivers measurable value across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Can Offer You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, supportive, and innovative environment where your contributions will make a real impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive compensation package (base + equity).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear progression plan. We want you to keep growing. That means trying new things, leading others, challenging the status quo and owning your impact. Always with our complete support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility: We see you as individuals first, employees second. This approach includes all the expected perks but goes beyond that to offer true flexibility. We’re proud to be a workplace that trusts our Nscalers to excel in their roles while giving you the freedom to shape your day- whether that means fitting in a school drop-off or taking a midday break for a walk with your dog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Working: Join our hybrid team, and enjoy the flexibility of self-led remote work, allowing you to create a productive and balanced work-life setup, while staying connected with your global team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Nscale, we are committed to fostering an inclusive, diverse, and equitable workplace. We believe that a variety of perspectives enriches our work environment, and we encourage applications from candidates of all backgrounds, experiences, and abilities. &amp;nbsp;We strongly encourage applications from people of colour, the LGBTQ+ community, people with disabilities, neurodivergent people, parents, carers, and people from lower socio-economic backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there’s anything we can do to accommodate your specific situation, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The range below reflects the base salary for the position. Actual compensation may vary based on job-related factors such as skill set, experience, education, and location. In addition to base salary, this role may be eligible for bonus, equity, and/or commission programs. Nscale may offer a competitive benefits package including medical, dental, vision, flexible paid time off, parental leave, and retirement plan participation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$130,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$220,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information on how Nscale handles candidate personal data, please see our Employee &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp%3Dsharing&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1765375172804000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ncte4rmlGl8OKuFuDgDtx&quot;&gt;Here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nscale does not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from recruitment agencies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;About Nscale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nscale is the GPU cloud engineered for AI. We provide cost-effective, high-performance infrastructure for AI start-ups and large enterprise customers. Nscale enables AI-focused companies to achieve superior results by reducing the complexity of AI development. Our GPU cloud bolsters technical capabilities and directly supports strategic business outcomes, including cost management, rapid innovation, and environmental responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thrive on a culture of relentless innovation, ownership, and accountability, where every team member takes pride in their work and drives it with excellence and urgency. As an Nscaler, you&#39;ll build trust through openness and transparency, where everyone is inspired to do their best work. If you join our team, you&#39;ll be contributing to building the technology that powers the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;About the Role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Director, Operational Readiness to build and lead Nscale&#39;s portfolio-level readiness capability, ensuring every new site, capacity expansion, and major infrastructure deployment is truly ready for production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Sr. Director, Technical Program Management, you&#39;ll set up the readiness framework, gates, scorecards, and transition model that bring our infrastructure into steady-state operations. You&#39;ll work across Development, Construction, Commissioning, Technical Program Management, Network, Compute, Security, Procurement, Legal, vendors, and Operations to surface dependencies early, manage exceptions, and align readiness with customer and operational milestones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operational Readiness doesn&#39;t replace program delivery, technical acceptance, or on-site Operations. It connects them. You&#39;ll provide the common model and portfolio-level assurance that leadership relies on to make confident go-live decisions, and you&#39;ll lead a growing team of Sr. Project Managers and Technical Writers who carry out readiness across our sites and regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What You&#39;ll be Doing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Readiness Operating Model &amp;amp; Portfolio Integration&lt;br&gt;• Build and lead Nscale&#39;s Operational Readiness capability and team, establishing and continuously improving the readiness lifecycle, gates, standards, governance, and escalation framework&lt;br&gt;• Define minimum readiness requirements across people, process, technology, tooling, documentation, training, vendor support, monitoring, ownership, and risk&lt;br&gt;• Establish clear readiness interfaces with Development, Construction, Commissioning, Technical Program Management, Network, Compute, Security, Procurement, Legal, vendors, and Operations&lt;br&gt;• Build integrated readiness plans that connect milestones, gates, dependencies, evidence, ownership, and decisions, and drive cross-functional gaps to clear ownership and resolution&lt;br&gt;• Maintain forward visibility into upcoming sites, expansions, and infrastructure programs so readiness work starts early&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Readiness Assurance &amp;amp; Transition&lt;br&gt;• Own the portfolio readiness scorecard as the single source for readiness reporting to executive leadership, covering status, material risks, dependencies, exceptions, and required decisions&lt;br&gt;• Govern the readiness gate process into steady-state Operations and issue formal gate recommendations for site go-live approval&lt;br&gt;• Make sure material readiness exceptions are resolved, deferred, or explicitly accepted by the appropriate functional or executive authority&lt;br&gt;• Keep a clear line between readiness assurance and the technical acceptance authority held by Commissioning, Engineering, and Operations&lt;br&gt;• Run early-life reviews on newly transitioned infrastructure and turn findings into stronger readiness standards and deployment practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Standards &amp;amp; Documentation&lt;br&gt;• Make sure readiness documentation, evidence, standards, and transition artifacts are complete, consistent, and reusable&lt;br&gt;• Use existing systems and governance wherever possible to avoid unnecessary process overhead&lt;br&gt;• Partner with on-site Operations to confirm readiness evidence for SOPs, MOPs, EOPs, and runbooks ahead of handoff&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team Leadership&lt;br&gt;• Build and lead a high-performing team of Sr. Project Managers and Technical Writers that scales with Nscale&#39;s deployment portfolio&lt;br&gt;• Create clear accountability, common methods, and consistent execution across regional and deployment readiness work&lt;br&gt;• Coach the team to work at both strategic and tactical levels in a fast-moving environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;About You&lt;br&gt;• 12+ years of progressive experience in data center infrastructure, mission-critical operations, technical program management, operational readiness, infrastructure operations, service delivery, reliability, or related large-scale technology environments&lt;br&gt;• Proven experience building or scaling readiness frameworks, operating models, transition processes, or cross-functional delivery capabilities&lt;br&gt;• Experience leading teams across multiple concurrent infrastructure initiatives and integrating dependencies across Engineering, Facilities, Operations, vendors, and program teams&lt;br&gt;• Strong understanding of how physical infrastructure, technology platforms, and steady-state operations connect, from planning and construction through commissioning, transition, and production&lt;br&gt;• Excellent executive communication, with the ability to translate technical and operational conditions into clear risks, decisions, and actions&lt;br&gt;• Ability to influence across organizational boundaries without direct authority&lt;br&gt;• Comfortable working at both strategic and tactical levels in a rapidly scaling environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to Have&lt;br&gt;• Experience with AI, HPC, GPU infrastructure, hyperscale data centers, or high-density infrastructure&lt;br&gt;• Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Computer Science, Information Technology, Business, or a related field (equivalent professional experience will be considered)&lt;br&gt;• Relevant certifications in data center infrastructure, technical program management, IT service management, reliability, or operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Nscale grows, more sites, technologies, vendors, and teams have to come together before infrastructure can enter production. Operational needs like staffing, tooling, documentation, monitoring, training, and vendor support must be identified early enough to develop alongside technical delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role makes that happen. You&#39;ll give leadership a clear, data-backed view of readiness across the portfolio, catch dependencies before they affect milestones, and make sure risks are explicitly owned rather than quietly passed on to Operations. The result is cleaner handoffs, fewer late blockers, and readiness that scales with Nscale&#39;s deployment pace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What We Can Offer You&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Nscale, you&#39;ll find a collaborative, supportive, and innovative environment where your contributions spark real impact. We&#39;re building something extraordinary, and we want you at the core.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Highly competitive US compensation package (base + bonus + equity), with performance reviews every 12 months. 🚀&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join one of the fastest-growing AI infrastructure companies — your chance to directly shape how global AI capacity is planned and deployed. ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expect a dynamic progression plan tailored to your ambitions. Grow by leading critical cross-functional initiatives and shaping capital strategy — always with our full support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Human-First Flexibility: We treat you as humans first. 🫶🏽 Our flexible workplace trusts Nscalers to deliver, giving you the autonomy to shape your day around life&#39;s moments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Equal Opportunities Statement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strongly encourage applications from people of colour, the LGBTQ+ community, people with disabilities, neurodivergent people, parents, carers, and people from lower socio-economic backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to accommodate your specific situation, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The responsibilities outlined in this job description are not exhaustive and are intended to provide a general overview of the position. The employee may be required to perform additional duties, tasks, and responsibilities as assigned by management, consistent with the skills and qualifications required for the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For information on how Nscale handles candidate personal data, please see our Employee &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice: Here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information on how Nscale handles candidate personal data, please see our Employee &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp%3Dsharing&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1765375172804000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ncte4rmlGl8OKuFuDgDtx&quot;&gt;Here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nscale does not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from recruitment agencies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let’s be honest: 2026 is a strange time to be in Talent Acquisition. Most recruiters are currently looking at their own internal dashboards with a sense of unease. They’re seeing the pivots, the shrinking req loads, and the ‘doing more with less’ memos. If you’re currently at a startup that’s struggling to find its footing, or a business where the hiring bar has dropped just to fill seats, you know exactly how fragile that ‘growth’ story feels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Samsara is the exception.&lt;/strong&gt; We are a fortress in a volatile market. We are a &lt;strong&gt;$2B ARR, NYSE-listed powerhouse&lt;/strong&gt; that sells essential technology to the physical operations powering the global economy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And we aren&#39;t just stable—we’re expanding. Our UK Mid-Market team grew &lt;strong&gt;70% year-over-year&lt;/strong&gt; last year, and we need the talent engine to match that velocity. We aren&#39;t looking for someone to manage inbounds; we’re looking for a recruiter who wants to move from a shaky seat into a high-conviction, high-growth environment where the fundamentals actually make sense.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Challenge:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-Sourced:&lt;/strong&gt; You own your destiny. You will be expected to find, engage, and convert your own pipeline using best-in-class tools like HireEZ, Juicebox, and LinkedIn Recruiter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The High Talent Bar:&lt;/strong&gt; We aren&#39;t looking for CV pushers. You will be expected to act as a rigorous gatekeeper, ensuring that only the top 1% of gritty, A player sales hunters make it into our process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Assessment:&lt;/strong&gt; You aren&#39;t checking vibes. You will be conducting deep-dive sales assessments, evaluating discovery mechanics, and ensuring every candidate has a structured methodology for success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute &amp;amp; Deliver:&lt;/strong&gt; Your mission is to fuel the Sales Account Executive engine. You will deliver high-quality, targeted pipelines at pace across EMEA, including the UK, France, Germany, and the Netherlands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Data:&lt;/strong&gt; You are the CEO of your funnel. You will have total ownership of your response rates, passthrough rates, and talent market mapping. We make decisions based on data, not gut feel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Sales Heavyweights:&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly with our Sales VP and GTM leaders to align on hiring strategies that move the needle. You are a consultant, not an order-taker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master the Craft of Strategic Talent Acquisition:&lt;/strong&gt; We hire for execution but develop for mastery. You will be mentored by some of the most sophisticated talent leaders in SaaS, learning how to move beyond execution to becoming a strategic talent partner who can influence the trajectory of an entire region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Backgrounds successful in this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Agency Foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; You started your career in a fast-paced recruiting agency. You still have that hunter DNA and the resilience to handle a relentless quarterly pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-House Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; In-house SaaS sales recruiting experience within a high-talent bar GTM organisation. You&#39;ve proven you can translate agency grit into internal success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EMEA Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve successfully closed reqs in the UK and at least one other European market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; You can speak the language of sales. You know the difference between an order-taker and a territory owner. You have experience hiring for a scaling playbook environment and understand how to identify the elite within this market from the B players.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Ideal Candidate is:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foundational Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; The goal is to bridge the gap between execution and influence. You are here to build the bulletproof foundations of an exceptional recruiter—learning how to own a region, influence high-level stakeholders, and use data as a weapon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Focused &amp;amp; Structured:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand that structuring your inputs—sourcing volume, message personalization, and rigorous screening—is the only way to get consistent output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Minded:&lt;/strong&gt; You study your own conversion rates and market talent availability to stay ahead of hiring needs.&lt;/li&gt;
