&lt;li&gt;A dynamic, fast paced individual who is motivated by success and takes the responsibility of owning issues to resolution. Understands the true meaning of “ownership” and “will do”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional internal and client centric interpersonal skills in a commercial situation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shown success in taking care of Enterprise clients and working on high level deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working on sophisticated RFPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competence with prioritising work and balancing workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent French &amp;amp; English verbal and written language skills&lt;/li&gt;
